  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> An extended talent lasts twice as long as normal. A talent with a duration of concentration, instantaneous, or permanent is not affected by this effect, but you may choose to activate this metamagic effect when spending a spell point to make a talent you are concentrating on last without concentration, rather than when you initially cast the sphere effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Cost:</strong> +1 spell point</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/metamagic-feats#toc26\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
